            </note>
            <note corresp="#d307-f2" n="10" xml:id="d307-f2-content">
                <p>Ratification advised by the Senate, with reservations and understandings, Feb.
                    10,1925; see <ref target="frus1923v02#pg_45"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                            Relations</hi>, 1923, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, pp.
                        45</ref>–<ref target="frus1923v02#pg_46">46</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
